      "id": "claim_8a065260cd064157a4a468b4fac680bb",
      "statement": "Route patterns are centralized as constants in RoutePool (e.g. USERS = \"/users\", REFUNDS = \"/refunds\") and used by PSPConnectorVertical with two configurable API prefixes (apiPrefix and apiPrefix2) so that legacy and newer refund endpoints can be exposed under different URL bases.",
