      "id": "claim_0ad879869ecf40aaafc6264385201971",
      "statement": "Domain route handlers are static-method classes wired at router construction time (e.g. PurchaseHandler::handle for POST/PUT /payments, UserRegistrationHandler::handle for POST /users, RefundHandler for the apiPrefix2 merchant refunds); each validates request input in the handler then delegates to a shared Provider implementation that is statically injected from Main.",
